Error/problem faced

A potential setup issue was the use of:

git init .

followed by:

git remote add origin ...

If the Colab directory already contained a Git repository or an origin remote, Git could report that the repository or remote already existed.

Resolution

The repository state was checked before pulling the required source. The project structure was then verified.

